title: AWS CloudFront Function
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS CloudFront Functions metrics via CloudWatch.
 Note: CloudFront Functions metrics are only available in the us-east-1 region.

 Monitored metrics:

 - Invocations: Number of function invocations

 - Compute Utilization: Share of the allowed execution time used (percent)

 - Execution Errors: Number of errors while running the function

 - Validation Errors: Number of invalid results returned by the function

 Thresholds can be configured for compute utilization, execution errors,
 and validation errors.

discovery:
 One service is created for each CloudFront Function discovered.
